  "schema_version": 2,
  "comment": "Skill-owned map from catalog items to code checks, shared by every repository. 'paths' are exact catalog heading paths (headings joined by ' > '). Map an item only when the checker verifies what the item says; a '参考情報' (references) or example sub-item follows its parent. An item routes to machine only when every listed checker is active; otherwise it falls back to AFM. 'applicability' lists selectors that show a component is on a rendered page; a page without any of them makes the component's items not applicable there. A document absent from 'applicability' is always applicable.",
